// ========== Enchanting rounds 203-204 unpicked Arcane add-ons (ripple, glints, runeWave, blink, trail), Q options, BASE197/wrapAdd197, Clf/A (moved out 2026-11-19; Arcane locked = kept + missiles + prism) ==========
